* EXECUTION: ONLINE TRANSACTION - SIFAPPRD LIBRARY
*            NOT SCHEDULED IN SIFAPJ01/SIFAPJ02 (BATCH)
* * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * *
